{
    "title": "1A Auto Diagnostic & Repair",
    "description": "The 1A Auto Diagnostic & Repair app will guide you through your automotive repair, whether you are a first time do-it-yourselfer or a life-long technician. With over 19,000 in-depth auto repair & diagnostic videos, you are sure to find answers to your automotive problems.\r\n\r\nThis car & truck repair app has the following features:\r\n- Learn from professional technicians about how to diagnose and repair vehicles like yours\r\n- Search the auto repair video library by your year, make, and model\r\n- Learn how to diagnose your vehicle using your senses \u2014 seeing, hearing, feeling, or smelling\r\n- Navigate check engine light codes and learn what causes them\r\n- Shop for the quality auto parts used in the videos\r\n- Use time stamps to jump ahead to the part of the video you need\r\n- Read the step-by-step written instructions for the repair\r\n- Save your favorite videos to easily reference later",
    "descriptionHTML": "The 1A Auto Diagnostic &amp; Repair app will guide you through your automotive repair, whether you are a first time do-it-yourselfer or a life-long technician. With over 19,000 in-depth auto repair &amp; diagnostic videos, you are sure to find answers to your automotive problems.<br><br>This car &amp; truck repair app has the following features:<br>- Learn from professional technicians about how to diagnose and repair vehicles like yours<br>- Search the auto repair video library by your year, make, and model<br>- Learn how to diagnose your vehicle using your senses \u2014 seeing, hearing, feeling, or smelling<br>- Navigate check engine light codes and learn what causes them<br>- Shop for the quality auto parts used in the videos<br>- Use time stamps to jump ahead to the part of the video you need<br>- Read the step-by-step written instructions for the repair<br>- Save your favorite videos to easily reference later",
    "summary": "Diagnostic & Auto Repair Help For Beginners, DIY'ers, AND Technicians!",
